  "meta": {
    "about": "array → PhotoCraft → VectorCraft → FigCraft → PhotoCraft → VectorCraft → array. The parlour game with pictures: the array engine draws a message, and each craft in turn opens what the last one handed over and passes on its own export: a cheap JPEG, an Image Trace, a half-size PNG, another cheap JPEG, a three-colour trace. The array engine lays every hop side by side and maps what was lost on the way as a heat map. Values cross six engine borders unchanged; the damage is all the crafts' own.",
    "tags": [
      "game",
      "images",
      "relay"
    ],
    "title": "Broken telephone"
  },
